-p ./config loads only the config package, so there is no main root: the
"not reachable from main/init" warning is expected on stderr, exit 0. The set is the
same as parsebool_call_site (strconv.ErrSyntax under *strconv.NumError.Unwrap must be
there; the early "return false, nil" adds nothing).
-- args --
-p ./config config/config.go:@strict
